# Supabase cloud-saves config (Alpha 4.25). Copy this file to
# `.env.local` and fill in the values from your Supabase project's
# Settings → API page. Without these, the game runs in local-only
# IndexedDB mode (existing behaviour pre-4.25). The auth modal /
# Account pill won't appear.
#
# The anon key is safe to commit / ship — RLS policies enforce
# per-user isolation. Don't paste the SERVICE-ROLE key here, ever.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
